# Composing Responses

You can nest models to create complex responses.

```python
class Address(BaseModel):
    street: str
    city: str

class UserResponse(BaseModel):
    username: str
    address: Address

@app.get("/users/{user_id}", response_model=UserResponse)
def get_user(user_id: int):
    return {
        "username": "alice",
        "address": {"street": "123 Main", "city": "Springfield"},
        "internal_id": 123  # filtered out
    }
```
